Provides tools for web search and content extraction. Useful for finding testing patterns, best practices for testing specific frameworks/libraries, or examples of how to test certain scenarios.
- `tavily-search`: Perform AI-powered web search.
- `tavily-extract`: Extract content from URLs found during search.

